  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "Go green for Red Sea!"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "The Underwater Observatory Park in Eilat is proud to pioneer an environmental and responsible change, which we hope will encourage others to join us and – ‘Go Green for Red Sea’!"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Our commitments:",
      "html": "<strong>Our commitments:</strong>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "– Recyclable plates and cutlery, made from natural and consumable materials",
      "html": "– Recyclable plates and cutlery, made from natural and consumable materials"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "– Paper or wheat drinking straws",
      "html": "– Paper or wheat drinking straws"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "– Replacing all single use plastic bags from gift shop with material bags",
      "html": "– Replacing all single use plastic bags from gift shop with material bags"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "– Dramatically reducing the printed materials used in the park and providing digital maps",
      "html": "– Dramatically reducing the printed materials used in the park and providing digital maps"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "– Reduce paper waste – change to e ticketing",
      "html": "– Reduce paper waste – change to e ticketing"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "– Reducing plastic bottles and cups and providing cans and glass bottles",
      "html": "– Reducing plastic bottles and cups and providing cans and glass bottles"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "– Encourage water fountain use!",
      "html": "– Encourage water fountain use!"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "– Offer multi-use fill up cups with logo for juice/slush drinks",
      "html": "– Offer multi-use fill up cups with logo for juice/slush drinks"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "– Multi-use bottles and coffee mugs, available for purchase in the gift shop.",
      "html": "– Multi-use bottles and coffee mugs, available for purchase in the gift shop."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "– Install more recycling bins.",
      "html": "– Install more recycling bins."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "src": "https://coralworld.co.il/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/sea_green-216x300.png",
